 Resonance Skill and cast Resonance Skill Form Switch shortly after casting this skill to cast Basic Attack - Aemeath Stage 3 automatically.\n\nStarlume Acceleration\nIn Starlume Acceleration, casting Resonance Liberation Heavenfall Edict: Overdrive addtionally restores Resonance Rate.\nCasting Resonance Liberation Heavenfall Edict: Overdrive ends Starlume Acceleration.","rows":[{"name":"Songs Across the Universe DMG","mult":[{"kind":"pct","hits":[[6.77,2],[54.16,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[7.33,2],[58.6,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[7.88,2],[63.04,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[8.66,2],[69.25,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[9.22,2],[73.7,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[9.85,2],[78.8,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[10.74,2],[85.91,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[11.63,2],[93.01,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[12.52,2],[100.12,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[13.46,2],[107.66,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[14.57,2],[116.55,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[15.68,2],[125.43,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[16.79,2],[134.31,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[17.9,2],[143.19,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[19.01,2],[152.07,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[20.12,2],[160.95,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[21.23,2],[169.83,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[22.34,2],[178.71,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[23.45,2],[187.59,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[24.56,2],[196.47,1]]}],"extra":[]},{"name":"Debut of Meteoric Radiance DMG","mult":[{"kind":"pct","hits":[[32.85,1],[49.27,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[35.54,1],[53.31,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[38.24,1],[57.35,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[42.01,1],[63.01,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[44.7,1],[67.05,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[47.8,1],[71.69,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[52.11,1],[78.16,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[56.41,1],[84.62,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[60.72,1],[91.08,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[65.3,1],[97.95,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[70.69,1],[106.03,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[76.07,1],[114.11,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[81.46,1],[122.19,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[86.85,1],[130.27,1]]},{"kind":"